{
  "no-filters": "<h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950\">Search</h2> <form method=\"GET\" class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-end gap-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm text-slate-700\"><label for=\"filter-eventType\">Event type</label> <input id=\"filter-eventType\" name=\"eventType\" type=\"text\" class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1\" aria-describedby=\"audit-event-type-help\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\" id=\"audit-event-type-help\">Show only events of this type, for example credential.value_revealed. Leave blank for all types.</p></div> <div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm text-slate-700\"><label for=\"filter-actorId\">Actor ID</label> <input id=\"filter-actorId\" name=\"actorId\" type=\"text\" class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1\" aria-describedby=\"audit-actor-help\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\" id=\"audit-actor-help\">Show only events performed by this user or machine identity ID. Leave blank for all actors.</p></div> <div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm text-slate-700\"><label for=\"filter-actorProvider\">Actor provider</label> <input id=\"filter-actorProvider\" name=\"actorProvider\" type=\"text\" class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1\" aria-describedby=\"audit-actor-provider-help\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\" id=\"audit-actor-provider-help\">The identity provider name of an external actor, for example the provider shown next to an \"Attested by issuer\" event. Use together with the actor subject.</p></div> <div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm text-slate-700\"><label for=\"filter-actorSubject\">Actor subject</label> <input id=\"filter-actorSubject\" name=\"actorSubject\" type=\"text\" class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1\" aria-describedby=\"audit-actor-subject-help\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\" id=\"audit-actor-subject-help\">The external actor's subject, matched exactly (case-sensitive). Use together with the actor provider; it cannot be combined with Actor ID.</p></div> <div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm text-slate-700\"><label for=\"filter-resourceId\">Resource ID</label> <input id=\"filter-resourceId\" name=\"resourceId\" type=\"text\" class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1\" aria-describedby=\"audit-resource-help\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\" id=\"audit-resource-help\">Show only events about this resource ID, such as a secret ID. Leave blank for all resources.</p></div> <div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm text-slate-700\"><label for=\"filter-projectId\">Project ID</label> <input id=\"filter-projectId\" name=\"projectId\" type=\"text\" class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1\" aria-describedby=\"audit-project-help\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\" id=\"audit-project-help\">Show only events from this project ID. Leave blank for all projects.</p></div> <label class=\"flex flex-col text-sm text-slate-700\" for=\"filter-from\">From <input id=\"filter-from\" name=\"from\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss.sssZ\" class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1\" aria-describedby=\"audit-date-range-help\"></label> <label class=\"flex flex-col text-sm text-slate-700\" for=\"filter-to\">To <input id=\"filter-to\" name=\"to\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss.sssZ\" class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1\" aria-describedby=\"audit-date-range-help\"></label> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\" id=\"audit-date-range-help\">Choose the date that controls this setting or filter.</p> <button type=\"submit\" class=\"rounded-xl bg-slate-950 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Search</button>  </form> ",
